==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Miltank|47}} from the {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}} expansion.
*This card's illustration rare artwork was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crown Zenith|Miltank|GG24}} from the {{TCG|Crown Zenith}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Rout''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Slaking|131}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

